# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Keeps Prettier (`endOfLine: lf`), rustfmt and tsc consistent across
# Windows and POSIX runners regardless of each user's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.sys binary
*.pdb binary
*.pem binary
*.cer binary
*.pfx binary
*.p12 binary
